WEBVTT

00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:16,300
I've always wanted to know why they say if you've never been pregnant or breastfed,

00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:20,740
that you have a higher risk for cancer, both through in my case.

00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:21,740
Why is that?

00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:32,940
Because if you've been pregnant and especially if you breastfed, you've used the lactation

00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:37,060
cells for the purposes that they're created.

00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:44,100
And by breastfeeding, it's done studies, women who breastfeed longer have a lower risk.

00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:50,980
So if you stop breastfeeding at three months and weed your baby at three months versus breastfeeding

00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:56,340
for two years and the baby naturally weeds off when that baby doesn't want to breastfeed

00:00:56,340 --> 00:01:04,140
anymore, those women have a lower risk of breast cancer and it has to do with the use of the

00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:05,620
breast tissue.

00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:13,220
So when you use the breast tissue and it's functioning the way it's supposed to function

00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:20,220
and it created milk that you do have a lower risk of breast cancer.

